00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:50,940
麦克斯
Max.

168
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:54,160
麦克斯 抱歉 但我们不能变成
Max, I'm sorry, but we can't turn into those people

169
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,880
那些为了柴米油盐拼命工作
who work and work just to pay their bill,

170
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:58,060
却没有时间追求梦想的人
and don't have any time to pursue their dreams.

171
00:07:58,260 --> 00:07:59,260
你是指全美国人吗
You mean Americans?

172
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:04,180
我明天就告诉琵琪我们不干
I'm telling Peach tomorrow we're not doing it.

173
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,220
现在去给我拿点牛奶
Now go get some milk.

174
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:08,800
没问题 因为在其位谋其政
No problem, cause that's what waitresses do

175
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,820
我们这一生就只有服务生的命了
and apparently that's all we'll ever be.

176
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:27,760
干嘛
What?

177
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:30,400
证明跟他的翻云覆雨很普通嘛
I have to prove the sex was not that good.

178
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,540
奥列格 居然在食物上做
Oleg, on the food?

179
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:34,920
干嘛用这么嫌弃的语气
Don't say it like that,

180
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:37,580
我们进去之前 那火腿就淋过汁了
That ham was already glaced before we go there.

181
00:08:48,937 --> 00:08:51,060
那你们俩算是复合咯
So I am guessing you are back together?

182
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:53,440
才没有呢 都说了只如浮云
Oh no no, the sex was not that good.

183
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:56,340
她都爽得飘飘欲仙了
Oh, it was that good.

184
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:05,760
我进去拿蛋黄酱
I went to get Mayo,

185
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:08,720
一切就迅雷不及掩耳地发生了
and it all happened so fast.

186
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:29,300
宝贝儿 来点时尚感
Ok babies, give me fashion,

187
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:31,180
来点表情 很好
give me a face, yeah.

188
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:33,720
琵琪 我不知道你在公寓里搞啥
Peach, I don't know what's going on in your apartment,

189
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,320
但我要先声明
but I would like it on the record:

190
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,400
我是非自愿的帮凶
I'm not a willing accomplice.

191
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:40,039
你到底在干嘛呢
So what is going on here?

192
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:43,233
布莱德如同本人 魅力十足
Well, Brad is giving us seduction like his name sake

193
00:09:43,233 --> 00:09:46,069
而安吉丽娜亦是 木头一个
and Angelina is giving us nothing like her name sake.

194
00:09:47,010 --> 00:09:48,259
这个布景看着真高级
This is pretty fancy set up,

195
00:09:48,259 --> 00:09:50,440
那俩孩子被奥斯卡提名了吗
were the kids nominated for an Oscar?

196
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:53,040
最佳窘境表演奖之窘境双娃
Best performance by twins in a ridiculous situation?

197
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:55,900
这是我新妈咪博客的宣传照
It's a photo spread for my new mummy blog,

198
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:59,400
我称其为"妈咪与我" 很有想法吧
I'm calling it Mummy and Me. Isn't that clever?

199
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,660
还很"原创"呢
And original.

200
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:04,300
我朋友康斯坦斯开博客后 我也跟上了
I had a blog since my friend Constance started her blog,

201
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,559
我们俩都有博客 都有孩子
we both have blogs and we both have babies.

202
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:08,883
不同的是 她的孩子是从非洲领养的
Only her babies are adopted from Africa.

203
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,580
为了不输给她 我找了
She will be winning if I didn't have two

204
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:11,960
乡下穷苦白人家的人当代理孕母
from a poor white hellbilly surrogate.

205
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:17,280
关于你朋友康斯坦斯
About your friend Constance,

206
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,380
我好像得帮她办派对...
I think I was supposed to do a party for her.

207
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,800
麦克斯 千万别搞砸
Max, please don't screw this up

208
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,660
因为我恨她 同时又需要她爱我
because I hate her and I need her to love me.

209
00:10:23,621 --> 00:10:25,420
我想说的是
Yeah, here is the thing.

210
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:28,240
感谢你的帮忙 但卡洛琳不该擅自打给你
Thank you, but Caroline should never have called you

211
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,120
让你帮我们忙
and asked you for a favor.

212
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,640
麻烦到你真是抱歉了
I'm not comfortable asking you to do that.

213
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,720
但我为了你伸出援手
But I did it, for you.

214
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:34,740
所以你也得为我伸出援手
And now you will do that for me.

215
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:37,020
麦克斯 这事务必得"一帆风顺"
And Max, this has to go swimmingly

216
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:38,580
这可是我刚学的新词哦
which is a new word I just learned.

217
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:41,560
你是说 我不能不干吗
So you are saying I can't get out of it?

218
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:44,780
我是说 麦克斯 你不能不干
I'm saying, Max, you can't get out of it.

219
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:51,080
麦克斯 还在因为琵琪的事不跟我说话吗
Max, still not talking to me because of the Peach thing?

220
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,560
好吧
Fine.

221
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:57,040
里面的奶油小蛋糕可真她娘的靓啊
Those are some pretty badass buttercream cupcakes,

222
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,260
都给爷在盒子里乖乖趴着等
ain't no drama going on in that box!

223
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:04,140
我都学黑帮腔调逗你了 也不赏脸笑一个吗
Ok, I just went gangster, and not even a smile?

224
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,480
干嘛啊 打算这辈子都不跟我说话了吗
What? Are you planning to never talk to me again?

225
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:10,240
你点头了 如果你是聋子 就算说话了
You nodded, if you were deaf that would be talking.

226
00:11:10,644 --> 00:11:13,160
没错 我弟弟是聋子
That's true, my brother is deaf,

227
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,760
不是先天的 是玩烟火闹的
not from birth, from firecrackers.

228
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:18,500
别紧张 我们还有时间
Relax, we still have time.

229
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,859
再坐10分钟地铁 然后步行15分钟
Ten more minutes on the train and a 15-minute walk.

230
00:11:20,859 --> 00:11:22,820
奶油不会这么快化的
The buttercreams are not gonna melt.

231
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:24,900
有人就喜欢用肢体语言制造恐慌
Some people just like to create non-verbal drama.

232
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,240
乘客们请注意
Attention passengers.

233
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:35,420
-前方铁路出现障碍物 -不是吧
- There is an obstruction up on the track ahead. - No.

234
00:11:35,660 --> 00:11:37,880
我猜肯定是有人跳轨自杀
I bet someone jumped in front of the train.

235
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:40,160
天啊 悲剧啊
Oh my God, what a tragedy,

236
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,260
奶油该化了
the buttercream!

237
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,480
乘客们请注意
Attention passengers.

238
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:49,360
我们为延误深表歉意
We apologize for this delay.

239
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,680
前方铁路障碍物尚未排除
There is still an obstruction on the tracks ahead.

240
00:11:52,660 --> 00:11:53,880
这障碍物绝对是尸体
It's totally like a body.

241
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:55,440
他们弄不掉还啥的
They can't get it off and what not.

242
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,560
列车很快就能开动
We should be moving shortly.

243
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,380
这家伙搞什么啊 这番话20分钟前都说过了
What is with this guy? He said that 20 minutes ago.

244
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:04,100
你的小蛋糕怎么样了 我的有点化了
How are your cupcakes? Mine are getting a little loose.

245
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,080
还这样 还不愿意说话是吗
Still? Still not talking?

246
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,180
好吧 麦克斯 那我也不说了
Fine, Max. Now I'm not talking neither.

247
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:13,260
她搞什么啊 这番话她20分钟前也说过了
What is with her? She said that 20 minutes ago, too.

248
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:16,420
她那嘴就是闲不下来啊
And she just keeps talking.

249
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,800
我知道
I know, right?

250
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,460
我们肯定是撞到人了
We probably hit the body.

251
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:22,501
血肉飞溅到轮子还啥的
So it is all up in the wheeling and what not.

252
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:26,360
如果我们轮子下真有啥的
Well, if there is what not under our wheels,

253
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,740
我就不能把小蛋糕送到目的地
and I don't get these cupcakes there,

254
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:29,560
我保姆的工作将不保
I'm going to lose my babysitting job.

255
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:31,780
-我们是保姆还是蛋糕师啊 -我在跟他说话
- Are we babysitters or bakers? - I was talking to him.

256
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,629
别多管闲事
Stay out of this.

257
00:12:32,629 --> 00:12:34,140
姑娘[西语]
Nina,

258
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,100
如果你们俩是蛋糕师
if you two are bakers,

259
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,720
或许你们该把小蛋糕拿出来分一分
maybe you should break up some of those cupcakes,

260
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,160
好让我们不被饿死
so we all don't starve.

261
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:40,180
谁也别想碰这些蛋糕
No one is touching these cupcakes.

262
00:12:40,180 --> 00:12:42,500
我们的未来全靠它们了
Our entire future is riding on these mothers.

263
00:12:43,580 --> 00:12:45,600
我好像闻到了尸体的味道
I think I'm smelling like a, like a dead body smell.

264
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:48,900
小姐 你一直在让大家更恐慌
Miss, you are making things so much worse in here.

265
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,740
别告诉我你没闻到
Are you telling me you don't smell that?

266
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:52,700
闻起来就像我妹妹烧到自己时
It's like when my sister burned herself

267
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:54,560
把烟火扔向我弟弟耳朵那样
throwing firecrackers at my brother's ear.

268
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,140
列车停止运行
This train is out of service.

269
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:03,860
离下一站大约还有两个街区远
We are approximately two blocks away from the next station.

270
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,260
我们会带大家步行过去
We're gonna have to take you on foot.

271
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:08,453
请站成一排 我们会安全护送你们出去
Please form a single line and we will escort you to safety.

272
00:13:08,453 --> 00:13:09,820
我们要走过去
We are gonna walk?

273
00:13:09,820 --> 00:13:12,180
他们居然想让我穿着高跟鞋走地铁隧道
They expect me to walk through a subway tunnel in heels?

274
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,960
各位 被困住时 要先吃谁有人选了
Hey everybody, I think we know who we are gonna eat first.

275
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:21,880
天啊 这里热死了 得有90多度吧
My god, it's so hot up in here. It's like 200 degrees.

276
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:23,859
如果我不慎晕倒跌下去
If I faint and fall down,

277
00:13:23,859 --> 00:13:26,164
老鼠们会生吃掉我还啥的
the others rats will like eat me and what not.

278
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,160
老鼠 麦克斯 这里还有老鼠啊
Rats? Max, are there rats?

279
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,740
地铁地板就是用老鼠铺出来的
It's a subway. The floor is made of rats,

280
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:33,200
不过你真该担心的是忍者神龟吧
but you really have to worry about, the ninja turtles.

281
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,040
谢谢你理我
Thank you for responding.

282
00:13:36,340 --> 00:13:36,740
等等
Hold up.

283
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,740
我现在就告诉你
I'm telling you right now.

284
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,380
如果我因为这件事丢了我的保姆工作
If I lose my babysitting job over this,

285
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:42,380
你会比被老鼠吃掉更惨
the rats would be the better option for you.

286
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,640
我们离下一站就两个街区 肯定能赶到
We are only two blocks from the station. We can still make it.

287
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:46,580
你的小蛋糕怎么样了
How are your cupcakes?

288
00:13:49,088 --> 00:13:50,751
它们还没有散
They are still holding together.

289
00:13:50,751 --> 00:13:53,535
就像咱们 我们还没有散
Like us. We are still holding together.

290
00:13:53,535 --> 00:13:57,644
拜托 别在这惺惺相惜了 少说话多走路吧
Geez, come on, don't bring gal. Less talk more walk.

291
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,540
伙计们 这里有个缺口
Folks, It's a bit of gap here.

292
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:02,480
缺口 不可能 怎么会有缺口呢
A gap? There can't be a gap. Why is there a gap?

293
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,760
因为人们需要合理价位的基本衣着啊
Because people need reasonably price basics.

294
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:07,760
我先跳过去 然后在那边接你们
I'm gonna hop across and help the rest of you over.

295
00:14:13,319 --> 00:14:14,980
小姐 到你了
Hey miss, you are next.

296
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,540
我一边用手电照着 你抓着我吧
I put the light on, just grab it.

297
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,700
我在隧道里听人让我"抓"他无数次了
You know how many times I heard that from a guy in the tunnel?

298
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,040
帮我拿着这个
Hey, just take these.

299
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,100
先生 小心点 那可是奶油
Careful, sir, it's buttercream!

300
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:28,060
我把包包扔给你 接好啦
I'm throwing you my purse. Here it comes.

301
00:14:33,671 --> 00:14:35,603
谢谢 谢谢各位
Thank you. Right. Thank you.

302
00:14:35,603 --> 00:14:36,960
好了 小姐 到你了
Ok, miss, you next.

303
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,280
把蛋糕递给我 然后跳过来
Hand me over the cupcakes and jump.

304
00:14:40,380 --> 00:14:42,060
我不敢 我好害怕
I can't. I'm terrified.

305
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:44,320
我跌倒了怎么办 老鼠会咬我的
What if I fall? The rats will eat me.

306
00:14:44,420 --> 00:14:45,620
这种伤痛我一辈子都无法忘记
I can never come back from that.

307
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:47,080
破产 没事 老鼠 大事
Bankruptcy? Yes. Rats? No.

308
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:48,420
"卡洛琳 你的脚趾呢
"Hey Caroline, where are your toes?"

309
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:49,700
这说来话长了..."
"Well, it's a long story."

310
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,120
姑娘 如果你跌到供电轨道上
Girl, if you fall that third rail,

311
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,100
你在被老鼠咬之前 就会被电熟了
it will fry you way before the rats get there.

312
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,480
听着 玛利亚 你要吓死我啊
Listen, Mariah, you are freaking me out.

313
00:14:57,480 --> 00:15:00,320
我们走运的话 老鼠会咬掉你的嘴
If we're lucky, the rats will eat your mouth.

314
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:05,500
卡洛琳 没事的 就跨出这一步吧
Caroline, it's ok. It's just a step. Take the step.

315
00:15:06,180 --> 00:15:06,860
帮我拿着
Hold these.

316
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:09,500
快点 我在这等你
Come on, I'm right here.

317
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,920
我跨出了一步 现在该轮到你了
I took the step, now you have to take the step.

318
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,800
说得对 你做了 我也要做
That's right. You did. I do.

319
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:16,520
那开始吧
Here we go.

320
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:19,060
各位后退 快点
Back up everybody. Yeah!

321
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:21,320
卡洛琳加油 卡洛琳加油
Go Caroline, go Caroline, go.

322
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:23,460
卡洛琳加油 卡洛琳加油
Go Caroline, go Caroline, go.

323
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:25,040
卡洛琳加油 卡洛琳加油
Go Caroline, go Caroline.

324
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:28,860
我看见老鼠了 我们四目相对了
I saw a rat. We made eye contact.

325
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:31,860
或许你把高跟鞋脱掉
You know what? It would probably be easier

326
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:33,020
会比较容易跳
if took those heels off.

327
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,500
先生 打死我都不可能
Sir, that is never going to happen.

328
00:15:35,680 --> 00:15:36,860
这里可是曼哈顿
We are in Manhattan.

329
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,920
虽然是在地下 但我仍身在其中
I may be under it but I'm still in it.

330
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,780
当别人救出我被吃掉一半的尸体时
And when they pull out my half-eaten body,

331
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:43,420
穿着高跟鞋才算死得体面
I will be wearing my heels.

332
00:15:49,443 --> 00:15:50,818
玛丽亚
Mariah?

333
00:15:50,954 --> 00:15:52,580
干嘛 我就吃了一个而已
